<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>🌡️ LIVE AIR TEMPERATURE</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Status:</b> LIVE / CURRENT MODEL (analysis, HRRR + RRFS-NA, GDPS fallback)</p><p><b>Source:</b> NOAA/NCEP HRRR 3km 2m analysis (CONUS domain) + NOAA RRFS North American output (broad domain) + ECCC GDPS 15km fallback<br/><a href="https://gsl.noaa.gov/rrfs/">https://gsl.noaa.gov/rrfs/</a></p><p>Transparent outside valid water data so existing project layers (shipwrecks, lighthouses, harbors, parks) stay visible. Turn on/off independently of all other layers.</p><p><i>Not endorsed by NOAA.</i></p><p><b>Coverage</b> — one at a time, switched right here in this folder:<br>○ Global Coverage<br>◉ <b>Continental Coverage</b> (shown)<br>○ Great Lakes Basin Coverage<br>Pro switches exclusively. Web/app: check exactly one box.</p>]]></description>
    <Folder>
      <name>LIVE AIR TEMPERATURE</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Coverage:</b> Continental Coverage<br><b>Precedence:</b> HRRR valid > RRFS-NA valid > GDPS valid > transparent. Explicit per-pixel validity masks; never blended, never duplicated.<br><b>Provenance:</b> {'hrrr': 'hrrr hrrr.20261014/23 n=701862/g=176900', 'rrfs_rrfs-na rrfs.20261014/18': 'n=573803/g=636144', 'rrfs_rrfs-conus rrfs.20261014/18': 'n=576889/g=54111', 'rrfs_rrfs-ak rrfs.20261014/18': 'n=678937/g=142730', 'gdps': 'GDPS_15km_AirTemp_2m n=5273396/g=6479996'}</p><p><b>Coverage</b> — one at a time, switched right here in this folder:<br>○ Global Coverage<br>◉ <b>Continental Coverage</b> (shown)<br>○ Great Lakes Basin Coverage<br>Pro switches exclusively. Web/app: check exactly one box.</p>]]></description>
      <Style>
        <ListStyle>
          <listItemType>radioFolder</listItemType>
        </ListStyle>
      </Style>
